flowchart LR
    N[Numerical inputs<br/>Quant models, market data, macro signals] --> S1[Stage 1: Evidence summary]
    T[Text-based inputs<br/>News and sentiment sources] --> S1

    S1 --> E[Structured overview<br/>Timestamped evidence summary]
    E --> S2[Stage 2: LLM report generation]

    S2 --> R[Investment report<br/>Rationale, risks, scenarios]
    S2 --> D[Machine-readable decision<br/>Stock/bond weights and confidence]

    R --> H[Human review]
    D --> H
    H --> P[Paper portfolio evaluation]
    P --> B[Benchmark comparison<br/>50/50 and 60/40]
    B --> M[Evaluation metrics<br/>Return, Sharpe, turnover, drawdown]
